@startuml roadmap-phases
!theme plain
title JSMF Roadmap — Stage Sequence (see docs/06-roadmap.md)

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor<<current>> #FFF3CD
  BorderColor<<current>> #B58900
}

[*] --> MockUI

state "1. Mock UI / Product Discovery" as MockUI <<current>> {
  [*] --> Build
  Build : Build screens against V1 Scope\nusing static mock data + mock auth
  Build --> Deploy
  Deploy : Deploy prototype to Vercel
  Deploy --> Share
  Share : Share link with reviewers\n(friends first, wider later)
  Share --> Iterate
  Iterate : Triage feedback, fix UX gaps,\nflag product-direction questions
  Iterate --> Deploy : more rounds needed
  Iterate --> [*] : converged, sign-off
}

MockUI --> FinalizeScope : mock UI signed off
state "2. Finalize V1 Requirements" as FinalizeScope
FinalizeScope --> ArchFinal
state "3. Architecture Finalization" as ArchFinal
ArchFinal --> Backend
state "4. Database / Backend Implementation" as Backend
Backend --> APIs
state "5. APIs" as APIs
APIs --> RealContent
state "6. Real Content" as RealContent
RealContent --> Auth
state "7. Authentication" as Auth
Auth --> Subscriptions
state "8. Subscriptions" as Subscriptions
Subscriptions --> ProdDeploy
state "9. Production Deployment" as ProdDeploy
ProdDeploy --> [*]

note right of MockUI
  Everything in this stage is frontend-only,
  static mock data, mock auth/payments.
  See docs/05-ui-ux-plan.md and
  docs/02-v1-scope.md "Current Stage".
end note

note bottom of ProdDeploy
  Downstream, non-blocking workstreams once
  the web platform is stable:
  - Flutter mobile apps (Android + iOS)
  - Future products (courses, PDFs, notes)
  See docs/06-roadmap.md "Downstream Workstreams".
end note

@enduml
